# Azurik: Rise of Perathia (4D530007): one route for the first run (no
# save is written before control). PLAYED by nav.py on the Thor, 2026-09-27
# 07:02 PDT (lane.titleroutes HELD session azurik.first-run-20260927T070214).
#
#   the intro FMV (A skips it) -> the title, "Press START to play" (START)
#   -> the save screen, cursor on "Start New Game" (A) -> the in-engine
#   opening in the temple (A presses) -> the Arena, "For your first
#   challenge, destroy the five orange vases ... Continue (A)" (A) -> player
#   control in the Arena, health and elemental gauges shown.
#
# In play A is jab, so a spare A in the tutorial boxes is harmless.
#
# Player control: LY min ran Azurik across the Arena and out through the
# far arch, LX turned him, A and X attacked (nav frames 006-gameplay ->
# 007-moved, in the room past the arch).
#
# Revised 2026-09-27 10:30 PDT, NOT yet replayed. The first soak
# (1-1790519287-titleroutes-2112912r) booted cold: at `a2` the Adrenium logo
# was still up at 8 fps, the one START was spent on the intro, and every
# later frame was the attract demo ("Press START to play. Press X for Game
# Demos"), so its reading is void. This version waits 20 s longer, presses A
# once more for the FMV, and presses START twice. The title shows "Press
# START to play" over the attract demo too, so a late START still starts;
# a spare START on the save screen either selects "Start New Game" (the A
# after it then lands in the opening, which A presses through) or does
# nothing. Two more A presses and 20 s more come before the mark.
#
# Still NOT replayed (2026-09-27 12:30 PDT). This version's soak,
# 1-1790527983-titleroutes-2100312, is void for a reason outside the route:
# hakuX did not have the Thor's input focus and an overlay covered display
# 0, so all 7 frames are black and the presses went to another app. Its
# 28.32 fps is not a reading of this title's gameplay.
wait 25.1
shot boot
wait 8.4
press A
wait 5.3
press A
wait 5.1
shot a2
wait 12
press A
wait 8
press START
wait 8
press START
wait 6.1
shot st
wait 9.8
press A
wait 8.1
shot new
wait 7.6
press A
wait 5.4
press A
wait 5.4
press A
wait 6.9
shot cut
wait 8.2
press A
wait 4.3
press A
wait 4.1
shot tut
wait 10
press A
wait 5
press A
wait 24.5
mark gameplay
repeat forever {
    axis LY min
    wait 2
    press A
    axis LX max
    wait 1
    press X
    axis LX mid
    axis LY max
    wait 2
    press A
    axis LX min
    wait 1
    press X
    axis LX mid
    axis LY mid
    wait 0.5
}
